    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Two of the angles in a triangle are $74^{\\circ}$ and $104^{\\circ}$. Work out the size of the third angle.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$2^{\\circ}$",
      "worked": "Let the third angle be $a^{\\circ}$. The angles in a triangle sum to $180^{\\circ}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}a+74+104&=180\\\\a&=180-178\\\\a&=2\\end{align*}$$\nThe third angle is $2^{\\circ}$.",
